com/drive/folders/1NtO6IocFk72Hfe_KA2FLU40VcOqMijmp?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@titipontakemiya/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e0158be1/uploads/origins/33202355-9ddd-4aff-8a1a-d15e0b2133eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c89647c65b08798234c525d385ff270", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e0158be1/uploads/origins/33202355-9ddd-4aff-8a1a-d15e0b2133eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c89647c65b08798234c525d385ff270, https://si.imgix.net/e0158be1/uploads/origins/33202355-9ddd-4aff-8a1a-d15e0b2133eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=62fdb01cc8946dcae508dca96a24f1b4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e0158be1/uploads/origins/33202355-9ddd-4aff-8a1a-d15e0b2133eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f6b2a25e6ad19e4f055cd587edcfd237 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "またまたこんにちは！前回作っていただいた絵がとても気に入ったので、またお願いがあります！\n私の2匹のサメのキャラクターを一緒に描いてもらえると嬉しいです！\n\nピンクのサメはとても元気でよく笑います。\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/6948353.yuuta?key=lrC99w2lurZzDKz\n\n青い方はあまり感情を表に出さず、いつもしかめっ面をしている！\n注：両目に星があります\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/6948343.tako?key=8ivRE4AfAqKUZ2m\n\n例えば、ブルーの子はオシャレをして、ピンクの子はお兄ちゃんが好きなことをしているとか。でもそれが無理なら、2人が一緒にいるかわいいものなら何でもいいと思います！\n\nありがとうございました！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@titipontakemiya/works/38", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fab61ea9/uploads/origins/a59404fd-7447-49e6-98e9-478e8361e737?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=880c93b7d8d7a15f020c8f4b070f1937", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fab61ea9/uploads/origins/a59404fd-7447-49e6-98e9-478e8361e737?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=880c93b7d8d7a15f020c8f4b070f1937, https://si.imgix.net/fab61ea9/uploads/origins/a59404fd-7447-49e6-98e9-478e8361e737?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=991018e84688697d6c25adf1be2832f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fab61ea9/uploads/origins/a59404fd-7447-49e6-98e9-478e8361e737?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fdedc94f2ec4c6ac3da3b5bb97a4e970 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのアートスタイルが大好きです！\n\n私のヤモリのキャラクターをリクエストしてもいいですか？名前は \"Frack\"。ヘビメタ音楽とエナジードリンクが好き。彼はとても大きな尻尾ととても長くて厚い舌を持っています。\n\nピアスやアクセサリーをつけてください。角が突き出ている帽子をかぶせてあげてください。好きなポーズと服を選んでください。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jjY33au1T7fhBxufakCyb75mNlEA-Sz3?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@titipontakemiya/works/37", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a9edc860/uploads/origins/7036fc7f-2134-4542-a0b1-1922522458ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=885dc8fbdd6d43b44185d6ef2f95eb49", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a9edc860/uploads/origins/7036fc7f-2134-4542-a0b1-1922522458ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=885dc8fbdd6d43b44185d6ef2f95eb49, https://si.imgix.net/a9edc860/uploads/origins/7036fc7f-2134-4542-a0b1-1922522458ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d0c71674f967ebcc6879e4f24a9fb6e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a9edc860/uploads/origins/7036fc7f-2134-4542-a0b1-1922522458ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee2a7e44afd7e873b0e141abe83556ca 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！僕のキャラクターでコミックスタイルの依頼を受けたいんだけど、レイアウトは君が決めてくれ！\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/14133133.cedar/gallery#43679446", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@titipontakemiya/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c6be3b5/uploads/origins/7f7542cc-4291-4976-8657-8a961acf8d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5e3cf3c8b431b9d7bfd7a8d9937b556", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6c6be3b5/uploads/origins/7f7542cc-4291-4976-8657-8a961acf8d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5e3cf3c8b431b9d7bfd7a8d9937b556, https://si.imgix.net/6c6be3b5/uploads/origins/7f7542cc-4291-4976-8657-8a961acf8d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=507af1b392cd7581dfb12c4ff7f02337 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6c6be3b5/uploads/origins/7f7542cc-4291-4976-8657-8a961acf8d29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aafaa90f92d9445b4dc220a5c7d14086 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "竹宮チチポンさん初めまして。\n私のOCであるゼノを、竹宮チチポンさんのお好きなように描いて頂きたいです。\n\n納品はpsd形式で、宛名・差分などがあれば別レイヤーでお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16wPfQJ74ZB1vA5u6NoHxiwBskevwHDpd", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@titipontakemiya/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cf1542e/uploads/origins/4357e299-4448-4564-8a2e-146a9befede1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66cc8c887721ae7fd8d7e18bc5e6cca6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cf1542e/uploads/origins/4357e299-4448-4564-8a2e-146a9befede1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66cc8c887721ae7fd8d7e18bc5e6cca6, https://si.imgix.net/3cf1542e/uploads/origins/4357e299-4448-4564-8a2e-146a9befede1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=179decb11e525cf724d7606af5b89a53 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cf1542e/uploads/origins/4357e299-4448-4564-8a2e-146a9befede1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=84ce44876a2727a7815d739ccd8f9fca 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! This is a magic cat that can open the portal. Its ability is very similar to the spotted ability of the recently released Spider-Man animation. It is followed by a little devil (that is, the little bat in reference)，you can draw him however you'd like. Thank you!\n\nhttps://s.mj.run/8w1PmzyHPOM  https://s.mj.run/xtJ56Et2e7Q\n\nhttps://s.mj.run/8w1PmzyHPOM", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@titipontakemiya/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc4eea21/uploads/origins/82a045e8-f54a-444f-a784-496113bc4da1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=99a7f2012ced17d9b62d40e10d16837c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cc4eea21/uploads/origins/82a045e8-f54a-444f-a784-496113bc4da1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=99a7f2012ced17d9b62d40e10d16837c, https://si.imgix.net/cc4eea21/uploads/origins/82a045e8-f54a-444f-a784-496113bc4da1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4af962c00347d0db23ec8a9065b4e1ff 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cc4eea21/uploads/origins/82a045e8-f54a-444f-a784-496113bc4da1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=8377fec57b2664d3c17eb512b9845685 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@titipontakemiya/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/df6b9c77/uploads/origins/23182cc9-7af1-4902-a39b-41def741ab70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39561c9f5bc4f026e5258e5be51f055b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df6b9c77/uploads/origins/23182cc9-7af1-4902-a39b-41def741ab70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39561c9f5bc4f026e5258e5be51f055b, https://si.imgix.net/df6b9c77/uploads/origins/23182cc9-7af1-4902-a39b-41def741ab70?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=20